ssets/steam/apps/1775080/extras/9bfd40d40b79187da8d41e7b77c4b244.avif?t=1743102342\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game you will find more than 30 species of dinosaurs, pterosaurs and paribas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
